# Build artifacts and deps that slipped through the per-directory rules above.
# node_modules was only ignored for web/ and sdk-js/, so video/ was leaking
# ~7000 files into `git status`; the compiled server binary (38MB) was untracked
# too, so a `git add .` would have committed it.
node_modules/
server/servermesrv
server/deployzysrv
video/out/
video/node_modules/.remotion/
